{"verse_key": "10:65", "surah": 10, "verse": 65, "text_uthmani": "وَلَا يَحْزُنكَ قَوْلُهُمْ ۘ إِنَّ ٱلْعِزَّةَ لِلَّهِ جَمِيعًا ۚ هُوَ ٱلسَّمِيعُ ٱلْعَلِيمُ", "translation": "And let not their speech grieve you. Indeed, honor [due to power] belongs to Allāh entirely. He is the Hearing, the Knowing.", "verse_from_ms": 1463130, "verse_to_ms": 1477810, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَلَا", "start_ms": 1463130, "end_ms": 1464090}, {"i": 1, "text": "يَحْزُنكَ", "start_ms": 1464090, "end_ms": 1465740}, {"i": 2, "text": "قَوْلُهُمْ", "start_ms": 1465740, "end_ms": 1467300}, {"i": 3, "text": "ۘ", "start_ms": 1467300, "end_ms": 1469090}, {"i": 4, "text": "إِنَّ", "start_ms": 1469090, "end_ms": 1470200}, {"i": 5, "text": "ٱلْعِزَّةَ", "start_ms": 1470200, "end_ms": 1471150}, {"i": 6, "text": "لِلَّهِ", "start_ms": 1471150, "end_ms": 1473050}, {"i": 7, "text": "جَمِيعًا", "start_ms": 1473050, "end_ms": 1473340}, {"i": 8, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 1473340, "end_ms": 1474570}, {"i": 9, "text": "هُوَ", "start_ms": 1474570, "end_ms": 1477255}, {"i": 10, "text": "ٱلسَّمِيعُ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 11, "text": "ٱلْعَلِيمُ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}